<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Trenwick, Zurich Re.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Trenwick, Zurich Re.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Trenwick Group Inc and Zurich Reinsurance Centre Holdings Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Trenwick closed at 52-1/4 Tuesday and Zurich ended at 31-1/4.</p>
</text>
